     "style": "methode",
     "title": "Calculating in other bases",
     "md": "Add or multiply column by column, **carrying when a column reaches the base** (not 10). 1011₂ + 110₂: 1 + 0 = 1; 1 + 1 = 10 (write 0 carry 1); 0 + 1 + 1 = 10 (write 0 carry 1); 1 + 1 = 10. The answer is 10001₂ (11 + 6 = 17). Or convert to base 10, calculate, and convert back."
    },
