     "type": "key",
     "style": "pieges",
     "title": "Common mistakes",
     "md": "- Using a digit not allowed in the base (a 5 in base 5).\n- Reading the remainders from top to bottom instead of bottom to top.\n- Carrying at 10 instead of at the base."
