    {
     "type": "example",
     "title": "Example 2: arithmetic and an unknown base",
     "statement": "Work out 1011₂ + 110₂ and 23₅ × 4₅. Find the base b if 21 in base b equals 17 in base 10.",
     "steps": [
      "1011₂ + 110₂ = 10001₂ (11 + 6 = 17).",
      "23₅ = 13 and 13 × 4 = 52 = 2 × 25 + 0 × 5 + 2, so 202₅.",
